ly prevents premium Codex from doing routine work. The architecture must identify the existing components to retain, the conflated boundaries to separate, the contracts and durable asynchronous job semantics required, the migration cut order, and executable acceptance evidence proving useful work continues without an interactive Codex session. Treat the four-minute workspace rebuild for one local dependency and the foreground two-minute inference adapter as architectural failures, not isolated bugs.ƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;CASXlKRmvVSuqxzqJ64maN_vupu6kCjk1HxR10NbnAYƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkdNoteƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;XwzgnLsrX7BBh_qtBez0y4iJecI1Rw5DT3LwTB_qKxwƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxurn:ame:leader-movement-teamƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;Kj0Eg8MNxPYqprzPJpeAMqOlPrCxjoFLFO6Esc9f1lIƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkfCreateƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;46gl-1heG929aUZVthsiIEk5cgns1xbI5Jzhk2JCn28ƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarksServiceSolicitationƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;x5NIk-GcrPuPs4HDpaKbgh0zXBI2O2Yb_5pzTvQ9AtUƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkxurn:ame:corpus-management-teamƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;7Jp5zgmc7SOGBO2NrpzrnWKoORe-VdmgbmV8iDhMr4Uƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkeOfferƒdpairƒhconstant‚dbasefEntityx9ni:///sha-256;t3of1PC3NXDeMeEHXrQAGCQPsJpIHU5zRBCkBmTHv3kƒdpairƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒerightdunitƒdleftdstardunit‚dmarkx2026-07-23T13:04:00.04